         "note": "Ink, one short line of five figures with no separators: 2 6 4 2 2, read 26.4.22 on the corpus convention. The 6 is a closed loop entered from above right, and the month figure carries the crossbar of a 4, so it is not a 9. No number and no name in the crop."
